# Research fixtures are frozen and identified by SHA-256 (see each MANIFEST.json).
# Never let git rewrite their line endings: a CRLF conversion on checkout would
# change the hashes and fail the manifest tests on Windows.
research/** -text
# research/ also holds files pinned by SHA-256 elsewhere: the pre-registration,
# the rule contracts and the shipped Splunk samples. Same rule, same reason.
